  lines:
  - "\u201CHow about a demonstration\u201D"
  - "\u201CHow about a demonstration\u201D"
  - ' It says before all fades to black and all of a sudden im right behind my father
    , the screw on his neck more evident than before'
  - ' It says before all fades to black and all of a sudden im right behind my father
    , the screw on his neck more evident than before'
  - "\u201CWhy don't you go ahead Nyx, show him your hair\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CWhy don't you go ahead Nyx, show him your hair\u201D\r\n"
  - "A screwdriver appears in my hands. \r\n"
  - "A screwdriver appears in my hands. \r\n"
  - "\u201CShall you punish him for averting his gaze?\u201D"
  - "\u201CShall you punish him for averting his gaze?\u201D"
  - 'It cackles sinisterly as i feel time rush faster than before

'
  - 'It cackles sinisterly as i feel time rush faster than before

'
  - "\u201CYour final payback , get back for all that ignoring and callousness, tick
