  textComponent: {fileID: 1669464683}
  nameTextComponent: {fileID: 1186241010}
  lines:
  - "The atmosphere thickens and an air on uncertainty and fear fill up my lungs
    like a smoker to her cigarette, through the mist of it all thats when I see the
    back of my fathers head , a screw nailed in his nape \r\n"
  - "The atmosphere thickens and an air on uncertainty and fear fill up my lungs
    like a smoker to her cigarette, through the mist of it all thats when I see the
    back of my fathers head , a screw nailed in his nape \r\n"
  - "\u201CD-dad??\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201CD-dad??\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201C...\u201D"
  - "\u201C...\u201D"
  - 'One horse is running on loop on the TV in front of him , his gaze fixed on it
    once again.

'
  - 'One horse is running on loop on the TV in front of him , his gaze fixed on it
    once again.

'
  - "\u201COh how you wish you two spoke more. Isn't that right, Nyxie\u201D\r\n"
  - "\u201COh how you wish you two spoke more. Isn't that right, Nyxie\u201D\r\n"
  - 'I hear an ominous whisper and lock eyes with an entity that makes my skin crawl.

