  lines:
  - It chuckles or I'd like to imagine a few lines of it just vibrated.
  - It chuckles or I'd like to imagine a few lines of it just vibrated.
  - "\u201C A question of sentience is a question of cruelty. Do you think baby birds
    are born with the knowledge that if they are unable to fly or pick up human scent
    their mothers would devour them?\r\n"
  - "\u201C A question of sentience is a question of cruelty. Do you think baby birds
    are born with the knowledge that if they are unable to fly or pick up human scent
    their mothers would devour them?\r\n"
  - "Or how us as people know our wrongdoings , does this self awareness alleviate
